            "bio": "\nPuneet stands out as a trailblazer in the industry with over a quarter-century in pivotal corporate roles encompassing Marketing, Revenue Optimization, and Distribution. Notably, Puneet's proprietary ventures in premier Restaurant and Bar projects have made a mark as elite brands in the market and enriched his portfolio with genuine entrepreneurial insights.\n\nPuneet's fervour for the Food and Beverage sector has carved a niche: he's been the linchpin behind the transformative Revenue Management Program that's been rolled out to over 100 restaurants worldwide. This initiative alone has generated an impressive surplus of US$ 3 million in revenue. His innovative spirit was further showcased with the co-founding of PerfectCheck, a pioneering automated revenue management solution for restaurants and bars, a first of its kind globally.\n\nOn the global stage, Puneet's influence has been significant. He championed as the Asia Pacific Chair for the HSMAI and held a prestigious seat on the Board of Directors of HEDNA.\n\nPuneet's academic accolades are equally commendable. He boasts an M.B.A. in Artificial Intelligence from the revered University of Cumbria, U.K. Furthermore, Puneet has undertaken executive studies in Entrepreneurship from the iconic Massachusetts Institute of Technology, U.S.A., and in Digital Transformation from the esteemed Columbia Business School, U.S.A.",
